{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1793742313","published":"2026-11-03T21:45:25Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:17:20.200929051Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-31911","CVE-2026-6244","CVE-2026-6554"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-31911, CVE-2026-6244, CVE-2026-6554","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: invalid opcode aborts the process in the BPF interpreter\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-31911.patch: reject the packet instead of\n       calling abort() on an invalid opcode in bpf/net/bpf_filter.c\n     - CVE-2026-31911\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: division by zero in the BPF interpreter\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-6244.patch: reject the packet on a zero\n       immediate divisor in 'div #k' and 'mod #k' in bpf/net/bpf_filter.c\n     - CVE-2026-6244\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: infinite loop on backward jumps in the BPF interpreter\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-6554.patch: limit backward 'ja' jumps per\n       packet and reject self-jumps in the validator in bpf/net/bpf_filter.c\n     - CVE-2026-6554","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libpcap-dev","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpcap-dev?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.8.1-6ubuntu1.18.04.2+tuxcare.els2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu18.04els/CLSA-2026-1793742313.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpcap0.8","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpcap0.8?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.8.1-6ubuntu1.18.04.2+tuxcare.els2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu18.04els/CLSA-2026-1793742313.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpcap0.8-dev","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpcap0.8-dev?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.8.1-6ubuntu1.18.04.2+tuxcare.els